  "notes": [
    "The pool closes 30 minutes before the building. The pool and heated amenities are adults only Monday to Friday, 5:30 am–1 pm.",
    "Monday, Wednesday and Friday open swim is in the activity pool only from 1 to 4 pm. Sunday’s first hour, 10–11 am, is Sensory Swim: no water features and no music.",
    "Lap swim is for ages 16 and over, and lanes are shared. There is no open swim during swim lessons (Tuesday and Thursday 4:30–7 pm, Saturday 8:30–11 am); in weeks without lessons the district extends Tuesday and Thursday open swim to 7 pm.",
    "On no-school days open swim starts at 11 am and the slide opens at 1 pm. The district says the schedule is subject to change without notice."
